	(text_box "T_{rise} = 65 ns (From datasheet, without C_{T})\nT_{fall} = 2.2 x (R_{DIS} || R_L) x C_L = 20-30 us aprox\n\nR_{DIS} = R_{PD} + R_{QOD} == R_{PD} = 750-850 kOhm aprox\n\nC_L = 20-30 nF aprox (PA's V_{REF} capacitors)\nR_L = 500 ohm aprox (V_{REF1} || V_{REF2})\nInternal R_{PD} = 750-850 kOhm, external R_{QOD} not placed"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
